SUMMARY:Santa Rosa City Works Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Public Works Week and learn all about the public infrastructure that makes our City a great place to live\, work\, and play. Infrastructure that our community has invested in is all around us and in our lives every day. \nActivities for All Ages!\nClimb Aboard Construction Equipment\nMeet Our Crew Members Who Design and Maintain our City’s Infrastructure\nWatch a CCTV Pipe-Cleaning Demo\nExplore What Makes Your City Work\nVisit City Booths to Learn Fun Facts about Public Works\nPlay the Infrastructure Scavenger Hunt!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/santa-rosa-city-works-festival/
