SUMMARY:Thotty's Naughty Revue
DESCRIPTION:Thotty McNaughty is thrilled to bring to Sebastopol a monthly revue featuring a wide variety of performers. The May show is Thotty’s actual birthday celebration! Enjoy burlesque and pole acts from Kim\, Troy\, Linda Lindo\, Wilee Walrus\, Lucky Lex\, Carrenne\, Thotty McNaughty\, and Krystle. \nDoors open at 7:00 PM Show starts at 7:30 PM at the Main Street Theater in Sebastopol\, an intimate up close experience. Tickets start at $25 for general admission\, $30 for 2nd row seating and $35 for the up close and immersive experience of the front row. \nMAIN STREET THEATER 104 N. MAIN ST. SEBASTOPOL
