SUMMARY:Avenue Q - A Left Edge Production
DESCRIPTION:Winner of the Tony “Triple Crown” for Best Musical\, Best Score and Best Book\, Avenue Q is part flesh\, part felt and packed with heart.\nBook by Jeff Whitty\nMusic and lyrics by Robert Lopez and Jeff Marx\nDirector and Choreographer: Serena Elize Flores \nThe laugh-out-loud musical tells the timeless story of a recent college grad named Princeton\, who moves into a shabby New York apartment all the way out on Avenue Q. He soon discovers that\, although the residents seem nice\, it’s clear that this is not your ordinary neighborhood. Together\, Princeton and his new-found friends struggle to find jobs\, dates and their ever-elusive purpose in life. \nDoors open 6:30 pm. \nTICKETS\nZONE A (Close to the action) $45\nZONE B (Middle of the house) $35\nZONE C (In the back) $25\nTickets at Door – $45 – So buy in advance! \nSPECIAL DATES\nFriday 5/22: OPENING NIGHT & PARTY – Stick around to celebrate after the show!\nWed 5/27: INDUSTRY NITE – Calling all theatre people! All tickets $20.\nThur 5/28: THRIFTY THURSDAY – $10 off all tickets
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/avenue-q-a-left-edge-production-2/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Theater
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
