SUMMARY:Memorial Day Weekend Adventure on the Russian River Railbikes
DESCRIPTION:Looking for the perfect Memorial Day Weekend outing?\nCelebrate the start of summer with Russian River Railbikes — Sonoma County’s unforgettable outdoor railbike experience through vineyards\, redwoods and the the scenic Russian River.\nPedal easy-to-ride railbikes along historic rail lines while enjoying:\nStunning river and redwood views\nFresh air and open spaces\nA fun experience for couples\, families\, and groups\nOne-of-a-kind photo opportunities\nA perfect pairing with local wineries\, breweries\, and coastal day trips\nMemorial Day weekend departures are filling quickly.\nReserve your Memorial Day Weekend ride now: www.russianriverrailbikes.org\nCreate a new Memorial Day tradition in Sonoma County.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/memorial-day-weekend-adventure-on-the-russian-river-railbikes/2026-05-23/
LOCATION:Russian River Railbikes\, 425 Asti Road\, Cloverdale\, 95425
CATEGORIES:Kids and Family,Recreation
END:VEVENT
